        The codebase is a creature
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-mist mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Naming the modules after the agent that lives inside them — heart, mind, senses, repertoire, nerves — turned out to change how the agent reads its own source.
